Production is live on 9.2.0.3, thanks for the support over the weekend. We ha=
ve one issue: timestamps in the outgoing status messages are shifted by one h=
our since the clock change on 25 Oct. Example: a pickup planned 08:00 local i=
s sent as 07:00. Ticket RW-48302, priority high because carriers use these ti=
mes for slot planning. Can you provide a hotfix today?

Kind regards,
